    "created_at": "2019-01-22T08:45:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-01-22T08:45:03Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I understand that, I probably should have made it clearer from the start that the proposal is not looking for such guarantees.  This is really just a proposal for making it easier for the component to do its thing (probably) after everything else, and in particular make that cooperation more natural by allowing the consumer to use the familiar `preventDefault()` to tell a component not to do whatever it normally does.",
