    "updated_at": "2023-10-30T09:34:12Z",
    "body": "After running into the problem I described, I came back here but realised that my original proposal wasn't particularly eloquent. So, I've tried to make this more of a discussion where a more concrete proposal might form naturally. It makes the comments preceding this one make less sense, but I thought it would be bad etiquette to start a new discussion for the same thing. I'm happy to do that, if it's preferred.",
